                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b790b91a-6809-33e6-9d2e-b8d16b412be0",
                        "entry_id": "053ca9e3-9f0c-352c-8ff0-069af02d724f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif ou ressemblant à Donald Trump."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "90626f6a-a28a-48b7-a147-f570abaa8ed3",
                                "sense_id": "b790b91a-6809-33e6-9d2e-b8d16b412be0",
                                "text": "L’isolationnisme trumpien se retrouve également dans les questions commerciales."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14ed2348-f587-4989-a0b4-dfb40ad902c7",
                                "sense_id": "b790b91a-6809-33e6-9d2e-b8d16b412be0",
                                "text": "Mardi, dans le Minnesota, elle anticipait son investiture pour prendre le contre-pied de la verve « trumpienne », affirmant vouloir « supprimer les barrières » plutôt que de « bâtir des murs »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8afa6f7-5f04-4012-9131-54eddd648ac0",
                                "sense_id": "b790b91a-6809-33e6-9d2e-b8d16b412be0",
                                "text": "Même sans le milliardaire, le débat a parfois pris une tonalité « trumpienne »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5af2f224-e341-4688-8dbf-7a12a85db248",
                                "sense_id": "b790b91a-6809-33e6-9d2e-b8d16b412be0",
                                "text": "Exemple d’argument trumpien adressé au dictateur coréen, cité par « Le Monde » (4/6) : « Imaginez seulement les copropriétés que l’on peut construire le long de ces plages ! (…) Vous pourriez avoir les meilleurs hôtels du monde. Pensez-y en termes d’immobilier. »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d890279d-ae86-4b36-bfb5-637083b68f62",
                        "source_entry_id": "053ca9e3-9f0c-352c-8ff0-069af02d724f",
                        "source_sense_id": "b790b91a-6809-33e6-9d2e-b8d16b412be0",
                        "target_lang_word": "Trumpian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Trumpian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                        "entry_id": "61e07b91-dc04-30c2-8c84-ed2f1697b3d6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or pertaining to the philosophy, rhetoric, and style of Donald Trump."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c184b97-28cd-49f1-94b5-534ced83092f",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "Good times … but then, a couple of weeks ago, Daffy was suddenly sputtering at us again. Such a magnificent Trumpian performance, such an unexpected gift, such bliss. The venue, of course, was “Page Six.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57282a4e-429e-4f3f-991d-8b294d770217",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "Operating in a command climate of Trumpian instability, the most senior and public White House officials are party to profoundly destabilizing acts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77bbdf65-3c24-45f3-b8c2-a5246179f9e9",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "China is internationally much more accepted as being in the top league and is calling the shots … In Trumpian terms, he’s managed to make China look great again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0f23b22-ed5f-4658-9aec-5dd7de9816ff",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "The made-up \"bible verses\" were of course in the form of Trumpian tweets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bce6875-88f9-456e-abaa-48df4fd26389",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "Beyond that, Schumer’s threat was Trumpian—a judge who displeases me will pay a price. His retraction was equally Trumpian: I didn’t threaten anyone. It would be okay if I had because in Brooklyn we threaten people all the time, but those aren’t threats, and anyway I would never, ever do what I just did."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2aa9a4f-6d3b-49d5-8ff9-9d7116bb0ddc",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "Both, in true Trumpian fashion, refused to concede."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7cabeaf-14dd-44e6-97fd-c5c112b7f946",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "And he’s dismayed that Mr. Biden has resorted to what he sees as Trumpian tactics to shut down dissenting voices in his party."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc577f99-e6e3-4226-ba69-41ebd0eb8377",
                                                "sense_id": "802264f9-52f0-3251-a262-e035886e4f53",
                                                "text": "There are plenty of reasons, Australians may reason, why our nation might be exempted from the threatened next round of Trumpian tariffs, on stuff like aluminium and pharmaceuticals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
